The procedure below has three parameters. The parameters x and z are passed by reference and y is passed by value.

```
proc t(x, y, z) =
    x <- x + y;
    y <- y * 2;
    z <- x - z;
end
a <- 4;  b <- 3;  c <- 10;
t(a, b, c);
```

(a) Give the values of a, b and c after the call. (b) Give the values again if y were also passed by reference.

